      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree the issue is real, but the proposed solution in OP isn't the best in terms of transparency and fairness in my opinion. Use of pressure such as time-limited purchases in the shop, and a lack of transparency about pricing information (overspending and hiding the costs to purchase virtual currency in bulk more than the required amount for a purchase), adapted to children, is something I see as a harmful practice to be solved.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
