      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} this isnt to do with the currentsy system itself, this is to do with being clear for creators that sell things to convert their earnings before they want to cash out what they've earned.\n\nsay you earn 58,000 \\V, but you dont know how much that translates to in $ and you only want to cashout when you reach a specific amount (say for tax reasons).\n\ncurently there is no official way to easly translate VRC Credits into the currentsy you want to cashout to. (Cashing IN money is a whole diffrent thing)\n\nPerhaps a solution to fix confusion about this is having it under the \"My store\" tab so only official creators can see it and it doesn't confuse others",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
