      "value": "@{62def591a3b0fa44be058bab|full_name} \n\nThis might not be what actually happens but in my opinion I think companies use a virtual currency to obscure how much users are actually spending. A predatory tactic to get users to keep spending since the user no longer sees it as actual money.\n\nThe main issue in my opinion is using a virtual currency in the first place.",
