      "value": "@{62def591a3b0fa44be058bab|full_name}\n\nLet me rephrase my statement. I think the main issue is converting to an arbitrary currency number when they could just use actual currency numbers. This way those who participate in the market can see tangible spending and earnings. \n\nBut ok, I'll ignore the broad issue that was brought up originally since this was a comment thread from someone else's point. If creators are using this system to pay bills and do business, there should be a lot more than just a simple calculator. VRC should be providing charts, graphs, real numbers, spreadsheets maybe, or just doing the calculations for you.\n\nTo me, if it wants to be a marketplace, it needs to be more serious.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
