      "value": "@{5e77efb6d430414fec89bb86|full_name} It has some already, they track each purchase, the time and date, how much they paid, how many people pay within those days aswell as graphs on it and downloadable CSVs for your store purchases. The graphs have even improved it since they first put it out. And they have said they are planning on making more graph content for creators. there are quite a few canines already on those specific issues.\n\nHere's some for example:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace-sellers/p/impression-tracking \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace/p/the-more-from-this-creator-section-on-avm-should-contain-a-dropdown\n\nAnd yes, VRChat really does need even more tools-  That's why I made this canny in the first place.\n\nEven if they plan on doing something, or are considering something, they still always want a canny made for it. This canny was made after a discussion about this exact topic a bunch of creators had in the marketplace.\n\nThe marketplace is new, and change takes time, espeshally when they are doing a tone of things at once, marketplace, items, accesories, SOBA, e.t.c. Complaining about what isn't there doesn't help the problem, make a canny if you feel something is missing  ^-^b",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
