  "details": "**Problem:**   Right now it's quite unclear and a bit of a pain to calculate the credit to USD (or other currency) money conversion.\n\n**Suggestion:**   Having a calculator in the wallet section of the market place website tab would be great to give an accurate rough estimate on what the credits turn into for your chosen currency.\n\nThere is currently this [ https://vrchat-credit-converter.com/ ]  but may not be 100% accurate all the time, and having an officially built in and supported calculator from VRChat themselves instead of a third party solution would be great, especially for newer creators on the marketplace!\n\n- Image 1: Example page for how it could look.\n\n- Image 2: Annotated image 1 explaining what parts do.\n\n- Image 3: Alternative location for it, being under the \"my store\" tab so only creators have access to it to avoid general public confusion.",
